HedronOS — a gaming-first Linux distribution.

  Your GPU driver was picked before this banner was written, and the machine knows it:
  run `hedronctl status` for the image build and what is tuned, `hedron-doctor status` for
  what disagrees with that.

  (No version string here, and no escapes either: sshd sends this file verbatim, so anything
  resembling a macro is a typo waiting to be shipped to a client.)
